{"id":"medium-015","difficulty":"medium","title":"最大连续 1 的个数","description":"二进制数组最大连续 1 个数。","function_signature":"def find_max_consecutive_ones(nums: list) -> int","entry_point":"find_max_consecutive_ones","constraints":"1 <= len <= 10^5","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["全0","全1"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,1,0,1,1,1]],"expected":3},{"args":[[1,0,1,1,0,1]],"expected":2}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[0,0,0]],"expected":0},{"args":[[1]],"expected":1},{"args":[[1,1,1]],"expected":3}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"扫描","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"全 0","代码实现":"```python\ndef find_max_consecutive_ones(nums: list) -> int:\n    best=cur=0\n    for x in nums:\n        if x==1: cur+=1; best=max(best,cur)\n        else: cur=0\n    return best\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}